{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:4e36481f8777817c","name":"Imperial Knight (CL 11)","source":{"id":"source:reference-4e36481f8777817c","title":"Imperial Knight (CL 11)","revision":25228,"timestamp":"2024-11-13T20:11:38Z","sha256":"489352678295c2a2bd348212eb4739af8bb5c4d5dad76344930d83375b717ba6","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=25228","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Imperial%20Knight%20%28CL%2011%29&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-4e36481f8777817c","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Imperial Knights"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Imperial_Knights","referenceId":"reference:f83f5f82e44c1559"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Fel Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Fel_Empire","referenceId":"reference:45bef1c82bffe9c1"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Imperial Knights"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Imperial_Knights","referenceId":"reference:f83f5f82e44c1559"}," are among the most talented and dangerous Force-users in the galaxy. Skilled in combat, they train under the tutelage of their Imperial masters, learning all they need to know to defend ",{"tag":"a","children":["Emperor Roan Fel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Emperor_Roan_Fel"}," against all those who would harm him. ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Imperial Knights"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Imperial_Knights","referenceId":"reference:f83f5f82e44c1559"}," are skilled with both the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," and with ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},", and make extensive use of combat armor, including their special ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cortosis Gauntlets"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cortosis_Gauntlets"}," designed to stop ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," attacks. From the start of their training until they reach full knighthood, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Imperial Knights"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Imperial_Knights","referenceId":"reference:f83f5f82e44c1559"}," learn how to use ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to transform themselves into living weapons and shields.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Imperial Knights"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Imperial_Knights","referenceId":"reference:f83f5f82e44c1559"}," train on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bastion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bastion","referenceId":"reference:863cf03d3363b90e"},", under the watchful eye of the Emperor. When a new potential student is identified, that student is drafted into Imperial service and placed under the tutelage of a veteran Imperial Knight. From that point on, the student trains under that Imperial Knight (with occasional assistance from other Knights) until reaching the point where knighthood is warranted. This training can take years and can be very harsh; however, no students fail out of Imperial Knight training, because the Empire demands success and always gets it. Upon achieving knighthood, an Imperial Knight serves the Emperor as a bodyguard and an agent, fighting alongside his or her brothers and sisters until death.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Imperial Knight Statistics (CL 11)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.mi